### Obter e-mails de alerta
GET http://localhost:5000/api/config/emails-alerta
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Definir lista completa (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/config/emails-alerta
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emails": ["alertas@example.com", "financeiro@example.com"]
}

### Adicionar um e-mail
POST http://localhost:5000/api/config/emails-alerta
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@example.com"
}

### Remover um e-mail
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/config/emails-alerta
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@example.com"
}
